{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29108","headline":"诏州驿楼宴罢 · 许浑","name":"诏州驿楼宴罢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"檐外千帆背夕阳，归心杳杳鬓苍苍。\n岭猨羣宿夜山静，沙鸟独飞秋水凉。\n露堕桂花棋局湿，风吹荷叶酒瓶香。\n主人不醉下楼去，月在南轩更漏长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}